{"body":"## Summary\nImplements Phase P4 of the approved Claude Design Parent Journey:\n- Child Progress dashboard with subject and strand-level objective marks (\\/parent/children/[childId]/progress\\)\n- 30-day, 3-month, and all-time practice filtering\n- Separated pedagogical recommendation card kept visually apart from student results\n- Paper Result detail screen keeping marked and pending marks strictly separate (\\/parent/results/[id]\\)\n- Question-by-question Worked Answer Review (\\/parent/results/[id]/review\\) with interactive filtering (All, Not correct, Not answered, With a person)\n- Enforced evidence floor: minimum 2 completed papers and 8 scored marks before evaluative claims appear\n- Four distinct progress states: Normal, Not enough to report (below floor), Nothing finished yet, and Partly unreadable\n- Parent-to-child data isolation and authorization checks on all routes\n\n## Quality Gate Evidence\n- TypeScript: tsc --noEmit (0 errors)\n- Vitest: 59 passed parent tests across 7 test suites\n- ESLint: 0 errors\n- Webpack production build: 69/69 routes compiled successfully\n- Playwright responsive tests: Desktop (1440px), Tablet (834px), Mobile (390px) captured\n\nDO NOT MERGE - Draft PR awaiting independent review.","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-11-08T11:05:49Z","authors":[{"email":"vishwas.joshi01@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Mjc4NDg1","login":"Vishwas2018","name":"Vish"},{"email":"noreply@anthropic.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","login":"claude","name":"Claude Opus 5"}],"committedDate":"2026-11-08T11:05:49Z","messageBody":"…mitives (P1)\n\n- Rebuild ParentShell with This week (/parent), Children (/parent/children), Account (/parent/account)\n- Surface Help in universal header and Billing inside Account\n- Implement mobile bottom nav below lg with 44px targets and WCAG 2.5.3 label in name\n- Restructure IA: add /parent/account, relocate curriculum & writing to /parent/children/[childId]/*\n- Redirect legacy /parent/curriculum-explorer and /parent/writing to default child\n- Implement reusable primitives: ChildSwitcher, MarksMeter (no %/bands), ClaimWithEvidence (>=2 papers, >=8 marks floor), and 4 mutually-exclusive state blocks\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","messageHeadline":"feat(parent): three-destination nav shell, bottom nav, and shared pri…","oid":"cb7e1496e555aa934d2923fb410fde06763790f7"},{"authoredDate":"2026-11-08T12:19:39Z","authors":[{"email":"vishwas.joshi01@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Mjc4NDg1","login":"Vishwas2018","name":"Vish"},{"email":"noreply@anthropic.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","login":"claude","name":"Claude Opus 5"}],"committedDate":"2026-11-08T12:19:39Z","messageBody":"- Replace ParentDashboard at /parent with FamilyOverview (artboards b5-b10)\n- Eliminate performanceBand() and percentage displays from parent render path\n- Enforce ClaimWithEvidence floor (>=2 papers / 8 marks) and MarksMeter for subject marks\n- Implement partial failure callout for unreadableRowCount > 0\n- Add honest states: Loading (role='status'), First visit (b6), Offline banner\n- Fix Account deletion copy to remove specific timeframe per Decision P11\n- Add comprehensive unit test suite for FamilyOverview\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","messageHeadline":"feat(parent): Family Overview 'This week' dashboard (P2)","oid":"23a24e2d2f708ce34970ad9e231bcd5256f024b8"},{"authoredDate":"2026-11-08T22:57:28Z","authors":[{"email":"vishwas.joshi01@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Mjc4NDg1","login":"Vishwas2018","name":"Vish"},{"email":"noreply@anthropic.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","login":"claude","name":"Claude Opus 5"}],"committedDate":"2026-11-08T22:57:28Z","messageBody":"- Scope evidence floor and MarksMeter paperCount to the specific strand\n- Prevent family and sibling totals from unlocking individual claims\n- Replace partial-failure text with neutral wording matching source count\n- Prevent unreadable or unavailable data from masquerading as first visit\n- Add regression tests verifying strand-level scoping and zero performance bands\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","messageHeadline":"fix(parent): address P2 review items in Family Overview","oid":"f931d491abf31d9c664f904f3255f6e0ac040100"},{"authoredDate":"2026-11-08T23:06:58Z","authors":[{"email":"vishwas.joshi01@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Mjc4NDg1","login":"Vishwas2018","name":"Vish"},{"email":"noreply@anthropic.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","login":"claude","name":"Claude Opus 5"}],"committedDate":"2026-11-08T23:06:58Z","messageBody":"- Support grouping='subject' in ClaimWithEvidence so below-floor copy matches underlying evidence\n- Pass grouping='subject' and explicit label in FamilyOverview\n- Add regression test verifying exact subject grouping terminology\n- Re-capture 390px loading, error, and offline state screenshots\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","messageHeadline":"fix(parent): resolve subject grouping terminology in ClaimWithEvidence","oid":"bdf0a752c5515e01ee82ed15de7b59a6916091a9"},{"authoredDate":"2026-11-10T06:21:05Z","authors":[{"email":"vishwas.joshi01@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Mjc4NDg1","login":"Vishwas2018","name":"Vish"}],"committedDate":"2026-11-10T06:21:05Z","messageBody":"…urriculum year focus (P1)","messageHeadline":"feat(parent): isolated preview gate, legacy route compatibility and c…","oid":"dd00db1a16629462c9d7431377ac4c9de84ba500"},{"authoredDate":"2026-11-10T10:52:06Z","authors":[{"email":"vishwas.joshi01@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Mjc4NDg1","login":"Vishwas2018","name":"Vish"}],"committedDate":"2026-11-10T10:52:06Z","messageBody":"…ly-overview","messageHeadline":"Merge branch 'feat/parent-nav-shell-primitives' into feat/parent-fami…","oid":"ccb1b2f92984febd691db3dc3ad49f2542ab8b0b"},{"authoredDate":"2026-11-10T11:06:04Z","authors":[{"email":"vishwas.joshi01@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1Mjc4NDg1","login":"Vishwas2018","name":"Vish"}],"committedDate":"2026-11-10T11:06:04Z","messag